cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "business-finance (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  Cash, runway, break-even and scenarios for a small venture, the economics of funding (equity, grants, debt, bootstrapping), and a program for runway and break-even from a model's numbers. Scope only.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tewf"
